# Only the workflow is committed: CLAUDE.md, process/ and tools/. Everything a run produces stays out (it lives on
# OneDrive): run folders, fetched company data (GBs, would double the OneDrive storage inside .git, can be re-fetched).
runs/
data/
acknowledgements.md

# Run data set aside (abandoned runs, replaced fetches)
archive/

# Local settings, caches and scratch
# .claude/settings.json (project config) is committed; personal overrides and runtime locks are not
.claude/settings.local.json
.claude/*.lock
__pycache__/
*.pyc
*.log
